== r3_origin, luau 0.742 -O2, run 1
fresh coroutine, listener first    debug.info(2,'s') = nil; debug.info(2,'f') is nil
coroutine.wrap, listener first     debug.info(2,'s') = nil; debug.info(2,'f') is nil
C caller (pcall) in a coroutine    debug.info(2,'s') = [C]; debug.info(2,'f') is function
Lua caller                         debug.info(2,'s') = ./r3_origin.luau; debug.info(2,'f') is function
## origin check per frame (200000 iters x 11 rounds)
case                                median ns        min        max    ratio     rmin     rmax
no check (baseline)                      5.04       4.52       5.70     1.00     1.00     1.00
call through a field, no check          18.96      17.84      20.08     3.76     3.41     4.19
debug.info(2, 'f') == nil               50.71      48.23      58.94    10.03     9.06    11.69
